{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30016_01_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:112cc1b404de830899f7e78e3facc3154e6ce9f1195db2f5d04c26e8781019ef",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34d8ab3c068a6776687a6e22ff5ed4d6aeebc1307f0178d6da0bba92c9e4b4b0",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n今天的拍摄，还请多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fb865a9c034e00eb6a5c3f90f71842d9cc8de6f00f750096d3e5e2f0fa2d76b",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n我们这边才要请您多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cbf0ffa29b57892cafac884cc874eab8ad0be94563204d94b122e848d01e4a9",
      "text": "红井先生、黑野先生，如果带了那台相机的话，\n能不能让我们看看二位拍好的照片呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b43bc45bf2bc3f9643092443984a1bf4afd4692f4a32d6eb334fc5bd773e84d",
      "text": "噢，带了。\n虽然还没拍出最合心意的，但大概是这种感觉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c35b7d1cd66cce531163a6f9b795229177d90e70c9a26a4dbdc2619446b14105",
      "text": "啊，真不错呢！喵子也很可爱。\n真不愧是很有红井先生风格的照片呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcb42f38423018701345c38c954b636c9872656bad40603cdab0a8e71df538f6",
      "text": "黑野先生这边怎么样呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02fce20987fd82e3aa9ae465ffad8369bce2ecf1c2fd8a986bdd6ec0a2f7a9a1",
      "text": "抱歉。我还完全没能拍出\n能拿得出手的成果。比预想的要费劲得多。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29d1f052ad93a24f4938483bdc79736e24fe83fd2479a04cb26f42faefddefaf",
      "text": "拍照这档子事，意外地挺难的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d24124b577918b9bb87ff606f465ae895fe1959dec794d83af09df4b8b8bc39a",
      "text": "哈哈，摄影一旦讲究起来，确实是没完没了的\n呢。我很期待黑野先生的照片哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ea2f09652bf7b3a07b2a341e114e84d48acc929a1fcf447f2d338e57b749ccd",
      "text": "啊啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:409b1d9e0f66817df85e79bfb0e63dadc74584dad762a4dd64d2c0e516ff54fa",
      "text": "（……玄武，没能拍出照片吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:702e0ece68096cec2cc17119bbae994f1437c9eda1a40c12315d9a47acf4f7b1",
      "text": "（而且，自打这次的工作开始之后，\n感觉他的话好像少了一些……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c20e3a7207136022b2dbb761669988a49d1beec41139dc6150181a15b87f0128",
      "text": "（这份工作对他来说，果然\n还是有点难办吧……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000107:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000116:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c78fb793d2486ab9317902643026f95f57e0f69b2aeda1dffbffab212bd3a05",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。能耽误一下吗？\n关于玄武的事，我有点在意的地方……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000118:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd7d26de244351674884375c0522f486045a256d1816d86068896a20bf7256b6",
      "text": "这次的工作，不是拜托我们要拍喜欢的、\n或者珍视的东西的照片嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000120:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:825e68d289591dd92a69509e3c174ee83b53079bdcdb85a504292168b81a5822",
      "text": "比如家人什么的……我在想，玄武这家伙，\n会不会其实根本提不起劲来啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000122:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cb70515e53602f02c42cf54f94432a2a0af331efb9fd82fcb43215eafc17bff",
      "text": "拍家人以外的照片\n也是完全可以的哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000125:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea453863a34285a4a25aa95e522d2868ee3feb667858f0c6d4c80c07f0cc621f",
      "text": "是那样没错啦。但是，一听到他说照片没能\n拍好什么的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000127:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23690f6381da3de127e345ba65fc21898ab9dd8d59307c142ae2bd20016c5648",
      "text": "玄武他那个……是一个人住的吧？\n以前在京都时候的事我也几乎没怎么听他提过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000129:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee818b3e279f19697c5dccbb8c05169f025e4da005ff25fe6d144f9b3a0ecac1",
      "text": "我就忍不住觉得他会不会有想说\n却说不出口的事情啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000131:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29d5c1221488612f88250c601aa408fce2bde21287fa0c92270e7d7d00cdeac7",
      "text": "我觉得直接去问问看他，\n才是最好的办法",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000134:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f8c35dd15b918857ef240d3213f803365a6f1d50b99b06dea55d705944c1a15",
      "text": "这样啊……也是呢。\n我去问问玄武好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000136:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8856cca43377b9be9ff79a5298acf9ee904551a1ddd4f9ec0294f404e1423e6c",
      "text": "谢谢你啦，制作人！\n明天我就去问问玄武！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
